window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>One spirals into obsession.</b><br> <b>Another seeks to find calm.</b><br> <b>But the leader? He wants to destroy me.</b></p> <p><b>All three own me.</b></p> <p>At Regents University of Law &amp; Economics, wealth and status reign supreme. I came for an education and to uncover the truth about my mother’s abandonment.</p> <p>But by catching the attention of three powerful students I find myself at the centre of age-old traditions within an elite secret society that extends far beyond campus. The Regents of Covenant House hold my fate in their hands, and as I uncover truths about a legacy I never knew existed, I realise that in a place where lies wield power, trust is a luxury I can’t afford.</p> <p>If I fail, they won’t just own me - they’ll ruin me.</p> <p><b>Covenant of Lies</b> is an enemies-to-lovers dark bully, secret society, academy romance and the first instalment in the<b> Tri-Rule </b>series.</p>"; 
